OL,3,GNEWSAClosed down private school put up
OL,4,Afor sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FA private school which was shut down by
OL,7,Fits owners earlier this year has been
OL,8,Fput up for sale by its administrators.
OL,10,FDurham High School was closed in July
OL,11,Fby Durham Education Ltd which is now in
OL,12,Fadministration.
OL,14,FThe school and its wider 14-acre site
OL,15,Fon South Road has now been put up for
OL,16,Fsale, according to property firm
OL,17,FSanderson Weatherall. Neil Bestwick,
OL,18,Ffrom the company, said the site could
OL,19,Fbe used for education purposes or
OL,20,Fredeveloped for a "variety of
OL,21,Falternative uses".
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
