OL,3,GNEWSAClosed down private school put up
OL,4,Afor sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FDurham Education director Yan Gao
OL,7,Fpreviously said the consortium was
OL,8,F"deeply sorry" for the closure, but
OL,9,Fsome pupils were described as "hugely
OL,10,Fdistressed" by having to move schools
OL,11,Fat a crucial time in their education.
